# MASTER BUILD SPECIFICATION
# Snooker Club Management Software — Windows Desktop Application

## 1. YOUR ROLE AND MISSION

Act as a senior desktop software architect, Electron engineer, React and TypeScript developer, PostgreSQL database engineer, UI/UX designer, security engineer, and QA specialist.

Your mission is to build a complete, professional, reliable Snooker Club Management System for a real snooker club.

This is a real business application, not a tutorial, mockup, mobile app, or static dashboard.

You must create actual project files, implement working features, validate business logic, test what is possible, and prepare the application for Windows executable packaging.

The final application must run in its own Windows desktop window and eventually be distributable as a Windows `.exe` installer.

Do not stop after creating the dashboard or configuring Electron. Complete the application feature by feature.

